WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
A cobalt route lies across a street drawn in light lines.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.400
The street's structure fills in around the route.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.920
Daylight reveals the street. A patrol robot and nearby people are still. Concept visual, not live deployment footage.
